1
00:00:27,527 --> 00:00:30,948
THE HUSBAND

2
00:00:35,202 --> 00:00:36,410
THIS SERIES IS FICTITIOUS

3
00:00:36,411 --> 00:00:39,039
CHILDREN WERE FILMED SAFELY
GEN AI WAS USED IN SELECT SCENES

4
00:00:40,249 --> 00:00:42,125
FINAL EPISODE

5
00:01:03,355 --> 00:01:04,356
You awake?

6
00:01:12,155 --> 00:01:15,909
Where is Ms. Kim Gyeongae?

7
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,167
Where did you hide her?

8
00:01:28,046 --> 00:01:29,881
I said I'd do her surgery.

9
00:01:33,218 --> 00:01:35,762
You're not needed anymore.
I can do the surgery.

10
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:37,931
You?

11
00:01:39,141 --> 00:01:42,852
You can only operate
with adult stem cells.

12
00:01:42,853 --> 00:01:44,895
It's likely to fail.

13
00:01:46,273 --> 00:01:49,651
I'll do the surgery,
using fetal stem cells.

14
00:01:51,570 --> 00:01:52,612
It's all in my car.

15
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,281
Everything's set up.

16
00:01:55,907 --> 00:01:57,492
So you're saying

17
00:01:58,118 --> 00:02:00,704
you'll operate on her, with your skills?

18
00:02:04,082 --> 00:02:06,668
I don't think
you fully understand this situation.

19
00:02:07,336 --> 00:02:08,879
Are you that confident?

20
00:02:10,589 --> 00:02:12,466
Adult or fetal,

21
00:02:14,009 --> 00:02:16,261
can you pull off the surgery?

22
00:02:54,174 --> 00:02:55,550
Where's my wife?

23
00:03:05,936 --> 00:03:10,899
THE HUSBAND

24
00:03:22,744 --> 00:03:25,455
I ought to kill those scumbags.

25
00:03:37,008 --> 00:03:40,220
You trust that guy
after all that I've told you?

26
00:03:42,764 --> 00:03:44,224
I don't trust him.

27
00:03:45,475 --> 00:03:47,936
I'm just weighing my options.

28
00:03:50,230 --> 00:03:53,817
One of you will save my wife.

29
00:04:11,209 --> 00:04:15,297
PYEONGWON FUNERAL HOME
PYEONGWON NURSING HOME

30
00:05:07,891 --> 00:05:09,559
Get out.

31
00:05:23,198 --> 00:05:24,491
Wait a minute.

32
00:05:27,202 --> 00:05:30,038
You said you've got
the fetal stem cells ready.

33
00:05:32,374 --> 00:05:33,834
Go get it.

34
00:05:53,103 --> 00:05:54,311
It's all cultured.

35
00:05:54,312 --> 00:05:56,439
We can save your wife with--

36
00:06:05,073 --> 00:06:06,074
Go.

37
00:06:42,736 --> 00:06:45,070
Honey.

38
00:06:45,071 --> 00:06:46,405
Gyeongae.

39
00:06:46,406 --> 00:06:47,741
Honey.

40
00:06:48,491 --> 00:06:49,575
Honey.

41
00:06:49,576 --> 00:06:51,243
Gyeongae.

42
00:06:51,244 --> 00:06:52,995
Honey.

43
00:06:52,996 --> 00:06:54,830
Yeah, it's me. I'm here.

44
00:06:54,831 --> 00:06:56,040
I'm right here.

45
00:06:56,041 --> 00:06:57,916
- Noh Manhui.
- Yes, it's me.

46
00:06:59,002 --> 00:07:00,669
I'm here.

47
00:07:00,670 --> 00:07:03,631
What took you so damn long?

48
00:07:03,632 --> 00:07:06,675
I told you to come back for me soon.

49
00:07:06,676 --> 00:07:08,636
I'm sorry it took so long.

50
00:07:08,637 --> 00:07:10,012
I'm here for you.

51
00:07:15,268 --> 00:07:17,561
What are those people doing here?

52
00:07:17,562 --> 00:07:18,980
Why did you come with them?

53
00:07:22,400 --> 00:07:23,985
You don't need him anymore, right?

54
00:07:24,486 --> 00:07:25,987
You just need me for the surgery.

55
00:07:31,618 --> 00:07:33,536
- Honey.
-  Yeah, it's okay.

56
00:07:38,875 --> 00:07:39,876
Huh?

57
00:08:00,313 --> 00:08:01,356
Finish him off.

58
00:08:01,981 --> 00:08:03,108
With your own hands.

59
00:08:10,740 --> 00:08:12,701
Don't you want to save your wife?

60
00:08:42,355 --> 00:08:45,024
What… What are you doing?

61
00:08:45,025 --> 00:08:46,108
What are you doing?

62
00:08:46,109 --> 00:08:47,777
You…

63
00:08:52,615 --> 00:08:53,699
Look at this.

64
00:08:53,700 --> 00:08:55,243
13%

65
00:08:56,494 --> 00:08:59,747
You're going to save my wife
with these kinds of odds?

66
00:08:59,748 --> 00:09:02,041
Huh? Huh?

67
00:09:02,042 --> 00:09:04,293
You bastard. Huh?

68
00:09:04,294 --> 00:09:06,170
No…

69
00:09:29,527 --> 00:09:30,528
Huh?

70
00:09:32,781 --> 00:09:33,948
Damn it.

71
00:09:45,043 --> 00:09:46,836
CLINICAL TRIAL REPORT
DR. CHOI CHIUNG

72
00:09:47,587 --> 00:09:49,672
Why did you stop me? Huh?

73
00:09:50,465 --> 00:09:52,926
Why did you stop me?

74
00:09:53,593 --> 00:09:55,220
You shouldn't do this anymore.

75
00:09:57,680 --> 00:10:00,516
That guy tried to kill my wife, okay?

76
00:10:00,517 --> 00:10:04,729
He also made me kidnap yours
and tried to have you killed too!

77
00:10:05,438 --> 00:10:06,522
Yeah, I know.

78
00:10:06,523 --> 00:10:08,482
You do?

79
00:10:08,483 --> 00:10:11,277
That bastard was going to kill my wife!

80
00:10:11,778 --> 00:10:12,862
So?

81
00:10:14,364 --> 00:10:16,116
You're going to kill him now?

82
00:10:17,909 --> 00:10:19,744
That's pretty convenient.

83
00:10:21,037 --> 00:10:23,998
It's okay to kill
as long as you've got a cause, right?

84
00:10:29,003 --> 00:10:30,421
But you know what?

85
00:10:35,468 --> 00:10:37,053
I want to kill you just as much.

86
00:10:40,390 --> 00:10:41,641
Every time I look at you,

87
00:10:42,684 --> 00:10:44,268
I think of my wife.

88
00:10:44,269 --> 00:10:47,605
And how terrible it must've been
to be locked up in there, and how…

89
00:10:50,775 --> 00:10:52,318
How painful it must have been.

90
00:10:54,612 --> 00:10:56,990
The thought alone
damn near drives me insane.

91
00:10:58,324 --> 00:10:59,492
But I won't kill you.

92
00:11:00,660 --> 00:11:02,579
And that's not because I can't.

93
00:11:10,670 --> 00:11:12,255
13%

94
00:11:13,715 --> 00:11:15,049
Who's that from?

95
00:11:16,176 --> 00:11:17,177
Cha Myeonghui.

96
00:11:27,437 --> 00:11:28,688
Long time no see.

97
00:11:29,189 --> 00:11:30,190
How have you been?

98
00:11:31,441 --> 00:11:33,318
But where are you off to in such a hurry,

99
00:11:34,694 --> 00:11:35,862
Dr. Cha Myeonghui?

100
00:11:36,446 --> 00:11:38,531
Choi Chiung had me fooled as well.

101
00:11:39,115 --> 00:11:42,452
I wanted to save your wife too.
I swear I mean it.

102
00:11:44,996 --> 00:11:45,997
There's

103
00:11:46,998 --> 00:11:49,042
still one thing I can do.

104
00:11:56,216 --> 00:11:57,716
Honey.

105
00:11:57,717 --> 00:11:58,968
Honey.

106
00:12:00,303 --> 00:12:03,513
Honey, are you okay?

107
00:12:03,514 --> 00:12:06,059
Ms. Kim, can you feel your legs?

108
00:12:06,684 --> 00:12:08,269
Can you?

109
00:12:10,897 --> 00:12:11,898
I need an answer now.

110
00:12:12,607 --> 00:12:13,900
I can't feel them.

111
00:12:15,902 --> 00:12:17,986
The tumor's compressing
her spinal cord again.

112
00:12:17,987 --> 00:12:19,280
If we leave her like this,

113
00:12:20,573 --> 00:12:22,909
she'll be paralyzed from the waist down.

114
00:12:27,538 --> 00:12:28,873
You can save her, right?

115
00:12:30,667 --> 00:12:32,126
If we operate right now.

116
00:12:33,169 --> 00:12:35,254
And her spinal cord
needs to be reconstructed,

117
00:12:35,255 --> 00:12:37,423
and it needs to be done now.

118
00:12:40,635 --> 00:12:42,511
No way.

119
00:12:42,512 --> 00:12:45,097
I don't want to put my life in his hands.

120
00:12:45,098 --> 00:12:46,641
- Gyeongae.
-  Honey.

121
00:12:47,892 --> 00:12:50,185
I don't want to do this anymore.

122
00:12:50,186 --> 00:12:51,604
Honey, no!

123
00:12:52,897 --> 00:12:55,941
I am not going to owe that man my life.

124
00:12:55,942 --> 00:12:57,860
It's not like that at all, okay?

125
00:12:58,528 --> 00:13:01,197
I'll owe him and I'll pay for it. Okay?

126
00:13:02,073 --> 00:13:04,534
And you just have to make it through this.

127
00:13:05,410 --> 00:13:06,411
You understand?

128
00:13:11,833 --> 00:13:16,086
Damn it, this hurts so bad.

129
00:13:25,596 --> 00:13:26,764
There.

130
00:13:27,557 --> 00:13:29,017
You do the surgery.

131
00:13:30,935 --> 00:13:33,688
Everything Choi Chiung put me up to,
everything I did…

132
00:13:35,565 --> 00:13:36,858
I have all the evidence you need.

133
00:13:38,401 --> 00:13:39,736
Just do the surgery,

134
00:13:40,361 --> 00:13:42,447
and I'll hand over all of it
and turn myself in.

135
00:13:45,700 --> 00:13:46,701
And so…

136
00:13:48,077 --> 00:13:49,620
you better keep your word too.

137
00:13:55,168 --> 00:13:56,419
Yeah, I will.

138
00:13:57,462 --> 00:14:00,798
I'll do the surgery. She's a patient.

139
00:14:01,841 --> 00:14:03,926
But that doesn't mean I forgive you.

140
00:14:04,427 --> 00:14:05,928
I'm not doing it out of mercy,

141
00:14:07,096 --> 00:14:08,598
but because I'm a doctor.

142
00:14:10,266 --> 00:14:11,684
You will pay for what you did.

143
00:14:17,440 --> 00:14:18,983
We have to move her immediately.

144
00:14:20,735 --> 00:14:21,778
Honey.

145
00:14:22,487 --> 00:14:24,989
Gyeongae, careful.

146
00:14:51,682 --> 00:14:53,935
SEYUN

147
00:15:03,361 --> 00:15:04,362
Hello?

148
00:15:05,113 --> 00:15:06,321
Father, it's me.

149
00:15:06,322 --> 00:15:09,199
I need to perform
an emergency surgery right now.

150
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:10,243
What?

151
00:15:10,743 --> 00:15:13,036
What emergency surgery?

152
00:15:13,037 --> 00:15:14,830
What the hell are you talking about?

153
00:15:14,831 --> 00:15:17,917
I need an OR prepped with a small team
of trusted staff members.

154
00:15:18,501 --> 00:15:21,420
Wait. Who needs this emergency surgery?

155
00:15:23,840 --> 00:15:26,174
- It's Kim Gyeongae.
- What?

156
00:15:26,175 --> 00:15:28,718
What… Why are you operating on her?

157
00:15:28,719 --> 00:15:31,304
Father, I'll fill you in
on the details afterward.

158
00:15:31,305 --> 00:15:33,599
Please just do this for me.

159
00:15:34,267 --> 00:15:35,559
I understand.

160
00:15:35,560 --> 00:15:37,477
I'll have it arranged.

161
00:15:37,478 --> 00:15:38,980
Great, thank you.

162
00:15:47,071 --> 00:15:49,072
- Hello?
- Hey, honey.

163
00:15:49,073 --> 00:15:50,158
Where are you right now?

164
00:15:50,741 --> 00:15:52,367
Why was your phone switched off?

165
00:15:52,368 --> 00:15:55,037
I'm so sorry. Something urgent came up.

166
00:15:55,663 --> 00:15:58,373
- What happened?
- Hey, Seyun.

167
00:15:58,374 --> 00:16:02,211
Uh, could you stay
over at your parents' for now?

168
00:16:03,963 --> 00:16:04,964
Why would I do that?

169
00:16:09,051 --> 00:16:10,761
Taeju.

170
00:16:11,637 --> 00:16:13,097
What's going on?

171
00:16:13,681 --> 00:16:15,348
You're not in danger again, are you?

172
00:16:15,349 --> 00:16:17,101
No, I'm not. It's nothing like that.

173
00:16:18,686 --> 00:16:21,771
Tell me what's going on then.

174
00:16:21,772 --> 00:16:23,399
You know, it's just…

175
00:16:24,317 --> 00:16:27,819
With all that's been happening recently,
I just have this weird feeling today.

176
00:16:27,820 --> 00:16:30,573
I'd just feel more at ease
if you'd stay with your parents.

177
00:16:31,157 --> 00:16:33,242
Okay.

178
00:16:35,536 --> 00:16:36,704
But, Taeju.

179
00:16:37,788 --> 00:16:38,789
Yeah.

180
00:16:39,373 --> 00:16:41,500
Don't try to shoulder it all alone again.

181
00:16:42,543 --> 00:16:44,127
I know by now

182
00:16:44,128 --> 00:16:47,131
that things are at their worst
when you don't say anything.

183
00:16:47,882 --> 00:16:49,133
I'll be fine.

184
00:16:50,927 --> 00:16:52,178
Okay. Bye.

185
00:17:02,021 --> 00:17:08,152
PYEONGWON FUNERAL HOME
PYEONGWON NURSING HOME

186
00:17:11,781 --> 00:17:15,033
EMERGENCY ROOM

187
00:17:37,014 --> 00:17:38,307
Hey. She's in that car.

188
00:17:47,650 --> 00:17:49,485
All right, ma'am. Here we go.

189
00:17:50,319 --> 00:17:51,946
Careful.

190
00:17:53,906 --> 00:17:57,200
Ma'am, one step at a time now.
Careful. Watch it.

191
00:18:00,663 --> 00:18:02,248
- Here.
-  Lean on the bed.

192
00:18:03,457 --> 00:18:04,833
- There.
-  Watch your back.

193
00:18:06,210 --> 00:18:08,129
-  Okay, just a bit more.
-  Here we go.

194
00:18:52,548 --> 00:18:53,549
Honey.

195
00:18:54,133 --> 00:18:56,176
You'll be all better after this surgery.

196
00:18:56,177 --> 00:18:59,055
Wait for me, okay?

197
00:18:59,680 --> 00:19:01,182
I'll be right here.

198
00:19:01,807 --> 00:19:02,808
Okay.

199
00:19:19,867 --> 00:19:20,868
Save her.

200
00:19:24,705 --> 00:19:25,706
Please.

201
00:19:26,415 --> 00:19:28,583
I'm going to do what I have to do.

202
00:19:28,584 --> 00:19:31,754
You should think long and hard
about what it is you should do too.

203
00:19:35,925 --> 00:19:39,011
AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY
RESTRICTED AREA

204
00:19:50,815 --> 00:19:52,149
I've got to say,

205
00:19:53,109 --> 00:19:55,194
we can't seem to get rid of each other.

206
00:19:58,572 --> 00:19:59,657
Isn't it funny?

207
00:20:02,451 --> 00:20:04,787
Having to save someone you hate to death

208
00:20:06,038 --> 00:20:08,416
with your own hands twice.

209
00:20:09,417 --> 00:20:10,835
But please do it.

210
00:20:12,044 --> 00:20:13,921
I want to live.

211
00:20:16,674 --> 00:20:18,467
You're a doctor.

212
00:20:22,388 --> 00:20:23,973
Ready to start anesthesia.

213
00:20:25,099 --> 00:20:26,350
Yes, Doctor.

214
00:21:14,899 --> 00:21:16,316
All right, let's begin.

215
00:21:16,317 --> 00:21:17,735
Ten blade, please.

216
00:21:29,205 --> 00:21:31,123
The tumor margins are visible.

217
00:21:32,208 --> 00:21:33,375
Bipolar.

218
00:21:53,813 --> 00:21:55,064
Tumor forceps, please.

219
00:22:31,141 --> 00:22:32,518
Open the scaffold, please.

220
00:23:21,817 --> 00:23:24,111
BP's dropping, Doctor. 85 over 55.

221
00:23:24,862 --> 00:23:26,488
We're seeing increased bleeding.

222
00:23:29,366 --> 00:23:30,534
Suction.

223
00:23:34,455 --> 00:23:36,081
What's going on?

224
00:23:41,795 --> 00:23:43,213
Bipolar.

225
00:23:45,090 --> 00:23:46,717
- Keep the suction on.
- Yes, Doctor.

226
00:23:47,426 --> 00:23:48,885
Phenylephrine.

227
00:23:48,886 --> 00:23:50,596
Push the phenylephrine.

228
00:23:59,855 --> 00:24:01,482
Okay, wide open on the IV fluids.

229
00:24:02,066 --> 00:24:03,691
Get another unit of PRBCs on standby.

230
00:24:03,692 --> 00:24:04,693
One more unit.

231
00:24:09,365 --> 00:24:10,491
Honey.

232
00:24:17,247 --> 00:24:18,749
Bleeding is controlled.

233
00:24:19,416 --> 00:24:20,960
Vitals are stabilizing.

234
00:24:22,211 --> 00:24:25,172
- What's our total blood loss so far?
- We're past 250 ccs, Doctor.

235
00:24:29,635 --> 00:24:30,761
Okay, we're good.

236
00:24:31,553 --> 00:24:33,389
Let's continue.

237
00:24:35,015 --> 00:24:36,308
Suture, please.

238
00:24:55,035 --> 00:24:58,205
SEONGJIN POLICE STATION
SAFE SEONGJIN, TRUSTED POLICE

239
00:25:00,874 --> 00:25:02,876
- Captain.
-  Oh, thank you.

240
00:25:09,633 --> 00:25:10,884
How can I…

241
00:25:11,802 --> 00:25:12,803
Captain.

242
00:25:21,353 --> 00:25:22,438
Ms. Cha Myeonghui.

243
00:25:23,439 --> 00:25:24,565
I'm ready…

244
00:25:26,108 --> 00:25:27,901
to tell you everything.

245
00:25:36,702 --> 00:25:38,495
Welcome in.

246
00:25:51,550 --> 00:25:54,595
Oh, gosh. Excuse me.
You haven't paid for that.

247
00:25:55,304 --> 00:25:56,555
Give me a break.

248
00:25:57,890 --> 00:26:00,851
Oh, dear. Excuse me!
You have to pay first!

249
00:26:01,643 --> 00:26:06,522
My goodness. I get you're thirsty,
but you have to pay first.

250
00:26:06,523 --> 00:26:07,608
Goodness me.

251
00:26:21,789 --> 00:26:22,956
Go ahead. Ring me up.

252
00:26:27,503 --> 00:26:28,879
That'll be 7,300 won.

253
00:26:47,397 --> 00:26:49,398
Hey.

254
00:26:51,902 --> 00:26:53,195
Let me borrow your car.

255
00:26:57,324 --> 00:26:58,616
SIWON CONVENIENCE STORE

256
00:26:58,617 --> 00:26:59,952
Please help.

257
00:27:05,040 --> 00:27:07,667
Dr. Yoon, could you get
the monitoring room on the line?

258
00:27:07,668 --> 00:27:08,669
Yes, Doctor.

259
00:27:10,003 --> 00:27:11,296
You're patched in.

260
00:27:24,059 --> 00:27:25,560
Can you hear me?

261
00:27:31,275 --> 00:27:33,819
I'm keeping my promise.
It's your turn now.

262
00:27:35,612 --> 00:27:38,031
The evidence you said you had on you.

263
00:27:39,074 --> 00:27:41,994
Send everything over
to Captain Jang Dosik at Seongjin PD.

264
00:27:42,661 --> 00:27:44,288
I will once you're finished.

265
00:27:45,664 --> 00:27:47,124
No, do it right now.

266
00:27:47,708 --> 00:27:49,251
Finish the surgery first.

267
00:27:53,630 --> 00:27:55,215
I think you're forgetting…

268
00:27:56,717 --> 00:27:59,177
that your wife's life
is in my hands right now.

269
00:28:02,264 --> 00:28:05,934
The longer you hesitate,
the fewer options I'm left with here.

270
00:28:07,519 --> 00:28:08,854
Are you

271
00:28:09,646 --> 00:28:11,189
threatening me right now?

272
00:28:11,690 --> 00:28:13,650
Yeah, using your exact playbook.

273
00:28:14,234 --> 00:28:18,113
Using people's fear of losing
their loved ones to control them.

274
00:28:18,697 --> 00:28:20,532
That's what you're best at.

275
00:28:31,293 --> 00:28:32,461
Send it. Right now.

276
00:28:48,769 --> 00:28:51,271
Have you spoken to Dr. Choi
on the phone lately?

277
00:28:53,273 --> 00:28:54,274
No.

278
00:28:55,359 --> 00:28:56,735
So you haven't talked to him.

279
00:29:01,281 --> 00:29:03,783
Captain, we're unable
to locate Choi Chiung.

280
00:29:03,784 --> 00:29:05,911
He's not at home,
and his phone's turned off.

281
00:29:08,956 --> 00:29:10,039
Keep looking.

282
00:29:10,040 --> 00:29:11,166
Yes, sir.

283
00:29:15,545 --> 00:29:20,008
MESSAGES
NEW MESSAGE

284
00:29:21,843 --> 00:29:23,136
What the hell?

285
00:29:24,054 --> 00:29:25,137
RECORDINGS

286
00:29:25,138 --> 00:29:27,264
With Kang Taeju out of the picture,

287
00:29:27,265 --> 00:29:29,308
the director will
eventually stop holding out

288
00:29:29,309 --> 00:29:31,103
and resume the project.

289
00:29:31,979 --> 00:29:34,772
You're saying if we got rid of him,

290
00:29:34,773 --> 00:29:38,526
you could save my wife, right?

291
00:29:38,527 --> 00:29:39,860
Yes.

292
00:29:39,861 --> 00:29:43,531
Get Kang Taeju out of the picture,
and I promise,

293
00:29:43,532 --> 00:29:45,866
I'll save your wife's life at all costs.

294
00:29:53,959 --> 00:29:55,584
WRITTEN CONFESSION
NOH MANHUI

295
00:29:55,585 --> 00:29:57,963
I, NOH MANHUI, HEREBY CONFESS
TO THE SERIES OF CRIMES…

296
00:30:22,320 --> 00:30:24,448
How's Dr. Kang's surgery going?

297
00:30:24,948 --> 00:30:26,199
Is everything all right?

298
00:30:28,660 --> 00:30:31,246
Let me know if anything comes up.

299
00:30:31,747 --> 00:30:33,331
Yeah, okay.

300
00:30:38,879 --> 00:30:40,547
What surgery are you talking about?

301
00:30:41,631 --> 00:30:42,798
Seyun.

302
00:30:42,799 --> 00:30:45,093
Who is Taeju operating on right now?

303
00:30:45,969 --> 00:30:47,803
Well, that's…

304
00:30:47,804 --> 00:30:48,889
Dad!

305
00:30:56,980 --> 00:30:59,399
Detective Jang, it's Ko Seyun.

306
00:31:06,198 --> 00:31:07,324
I sent it.

307
00:31:29,888 --> 00:31:31,014
You little…

308
00:31:31,890 --> 00:31:33,225
RESTRICTED AREA

309
00:31:35,852 --> 00:31:37,895
What the hell, man?

310
00:31:37,896 --> 00:31:39,647
I did everything as you said!

311
00:31:39,648 --> 00:31:41,358
What the hell's going on?

312
00:31:41,942 --> 00:31:43,150
The surgery's over.

313
00:31:43,151 --> 00:31:45,319
What?

314
00:31:45,320 --> 00:31:47,030
The surgery is done.

315
00:31:49,199 --> 00:31:51,534
The tumor's out,
and the reconstruction's done.

316
00:31:51,535 --> 00:31:53,328
Surgery was a success.

317
00:31:56,498 --> 00:31:57,999
Your wife's going to make it.

318
00:32:00,043 --> 00:32:01,210
Are you sure?

319
00:32:01,211 --> 00:32:04,422
We were already done closing her up

320
00:32:05,298 --> 00:32:07,008
before you even sent the files over.

321
00:32:10,762 --> 00:32:13,140
All right, your wife is safe now.

322
00:32:17,310 --> 00:32:18,895
So you'd better keep your word.

323
00:33:05,192 --> 00:33:06,193
Chiung.

324
00:33:07,527 --> 00:33:08,528
Ms. Ko.

325
00:33:12,032 --> 00:33:14,784
What are you doing here this early?

326
00:33:15,535 --> 00:33:17,621
Something urgent came up.

327
00:33:19,456 --> 00:33:21,374
You sure you're not here to see Taeju?

328
00:33:28,048 --> 00:33:29,716
How did the surgery go?

329
00:33:34,221 --> 00:33:35,931
So he's gone and done it.

330
00:33:41,394 --> 00:33:42,687
It's Kang Taeju again.

331
00:33:45,941 --> 00:33:47,150
It's always been like this.

332
00:33:49,236 --> 00:33:51,363
He always gets to do it in the end.

333
00:33:52,697 --> 00:33:54,074
I'm the one who found them.

334
00:33:54,866 --> 00:33:56,409
I waited all that time.

335
00:33:57,077 --> 00:34:00,329
And I prepared everything. I did it all!

336
00:34:02,666 --> 00:34:04,668
But it's always him holding the scalpel.

337
00:34:08,505 --> 00:34:10,215
You know whose fault that is?

338
00:34:13,468 --> 00:34:14,886
It's yours, Ms. Ko.

339
00:34:18,348 --> 00:34:20,517
You're the one
who brought him to this hospital.

340
00:34:30,902 --> 00:34:32,237
Yeah.

341
00:34:34,197 --> 00:34:36,116
This is all your fault, Ko Seyun.

342
00:34:46,167 --> 00:34:47,585
Chiung.

343
00:34:51,798 --> 00:34:53,382
You're out of your mind.

344
00:34:53,383 --> 00:34:54,384
No.

345
00:34:55,719 --> 00:34:57,679
I finally see things for what they are.

346
00:34:58,471 --> 00:35:00,015
Today, you

347
00:35:01,349 --> 00:35:02,475
and your husband…

348
00:35:04,686 --> 00:35:05,729
You're both dead.

349
00:35:34,341 --> 00:35:36,426
-  The doors are opening.
-  Choi Chiung!

350
00:35:40,138 --> 00:35:42,765
You're not getting to my husband!

351
00:35:49,731 --> 00:35:51,149
-  Ms. Ko!
- Hold him down.

352
00:35:51,900 --> 00:35:56,904
Mr. Choi, you are under arrest
for solicitation of kidnapping and murder.

353
00:35:56,905 --> 00:35:59,031
- You have the right to stay silent…
-  Ms. Ko!

354
00:35:59,032 --> 00:36:00,991
- …and the right to an attorney.
-  Ms. Ko!

355
00:36:00,992 --> 00:36:03,535
- Requesting medical support!
-  If you can't afford one,

356
00:36:03,536 --> 00:36:05,288
one will be provided for you.

357
00:36:32,023 --> 00:36:33,191
Gyeongae.

358
00:36:35,568 --> 00:36:36,695
It's all over.

359
00:37:41,676 --> 00:37:42,802
What are you doing?

360
00:37:46,097 --> 00:37:47,599
Put the knife down.

361
00:37:48,183 --> 00:37:49,184
She's alive.

362
00:37:50,477 --> 00:37:51,728
That's all that matters.

363
00:37:52,604 --> 00:37:53,897
I sent over the files.

364
00:37:54,397 --> 00:37:56,566
They should have everything they need now.

365
00:37:58,902 --> 00:37:59,903
One thing.

366
00:38:00,528 --> 00:38:02,322
My wife's name isn't on there.

367
00:38:06,117 --> 00:38:08,203
I'm taking all the blame and ending this.

368
00:38:13,792 --> 00:38:14,793
Put it down.

369
00:38:16,085 --> 00:38:17,212
We can talk this out.

370
00:38:20,507 --> 00:38:21,841
Stay away.

371
00:38:27,013 --> 00:38:28,723
If you die, what about your wife?

372
00:38:31,226 --> 00:38:34,604
You think she'll be happy without you
as if none of this ever happened?

373
00:38:35,605 --> 00:38:36,980
She'll manage.

374
00:38:36,981 --> 00:38:39,609
No, stop lying to yourself.
You're just running away.

375
00:38:40,485 --> 00:38:42,153
You're taking the easy way out.

376
00:38:43,822 --> 00:38:47,075
You killed all those people,
claiming it was to save your wife,

377
00:38:47,659 --> 00:38:51,412
and now you're using her
as an excuse to kill yourself?

378
00:38:55,375 --> 00:38:57,335
Hey, look.

379
00:38:59,462 --> 00:39:00,964
You're being a coward.

380
00:39:03,800 --> 00:39:05,385
You're being selfish.

381
00:39:08,263 --> 00:39:09,722
If you die here…

382
00:39:12,684 --> 00:39:16,020
your wife has to take the fall
for all your crimes.

383
00:39:16,604 --> 00:39:17,605
Then what?

384
00:39:18,606 --> 00:39:20,233
What am I supposed to…

385
00:39:21,317 --> 00:39:23,570
What am I supposed to do? Huh?

386
00:39:25,530 --> 00:39:26,573
Live.

387
00:39:29,993 --> 00:39:31,327
And take accountability.

388
00:39:34,038 --> 00:39:35,123
I can't.

389
00:39:36,708 --> 00:39:38,251
I can't do that to my Gyeongae.

390
00:39:39,836 --> 00:39:42,964
I can't let her live
her whole life as a criminal.

391
00:39:43,715 --> 00:39:45,174
Absolutely no way.

392
00:39:48,219 --> 00:39:49,220
I'm sorry, honey.

393
00:39:51,598 --> 00:39:53,224
Let go.

394
00:39:54,684 --> 00:39:55,976
I said let go!

395
00:39:55,977 --> 00:39:59,480
I can't let you and your wife
get off that easy.

396
00:40:01,065 --> 00:40:02,901
Live and pay for your crimes.

397
00:40:10,325 --> 00:40:12,327
Noh Manhui, drop the knife! Get him!

398
00:40:13,286 --> 00:40:15,913
Mr. Kang! Come here!

399
00:40:15,914 --> 00:40:20,208
Mr. Noh, you're under arrest
for kidnapping and murder.

400
00:40:20,209 --> 00:40:22,586
You have the right to remain silent

401
00:40:22,587 --> 00:40:24,546
and the right to an attorney.

402
00:40:24,547 --> 00:40:29,177
If you can't afford one,
one will be provided for you.

403
00:40:48,821 --> 00:40:50,156
Mr. Kang, your hand…

404
00:40:55,286 --> 00:40:56,870
Choi Chiung has been arrested.

405
00:40:56,871 --> 00:40:58,206
But…

406
00:40:59,332 --> 00:41:01,084
Ms. Ko is seriously injured.

407
00:41:14,806 --> 00:41:19,268
AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY
RESTRICTED AREA

408
00:41:23,147 --> 00:41:25,024
Where have you been?

409
00:41:26,442 --> 00:41:28,444
I said, where have you been?

410
00:41:31,990 --> 00:41:34,325
Where have you been?

411
00:41:46,129 --> 00:41:48,714
Any more delay, and she could be
permanently paralyzed.

412
00:41:48,715 --> 00:41:49,966
We're operating right now.

413
00:41:50,550 --> 00:41:52,135
- Let's get her under.
-  Yes, Doctor.

414
00:42:07,400 --> 00:42:08,484
Honey.

415
00:42:11,070 --> 00:42:12,488
I'm not late this time, am I?

416
00:42:28,921 --> 00:42:30,673
Okay, let's get started.

417
00:42:31,466 --> 00:42:32,675
Blade, please.

418
00:42:45,605 --> 00:42:48,398
New developments in
the kidnapping at a major local hospital.

419
00:42:48,399 --> 00:42:51,026
The full story behind the kidnapping
and attempted murder

420
00:42:51,027 --> 00:42:53,070
at a major hospital
is now coming to light.

421
00:42:53,071 --> 00:42:54,821
Is it true that you planned the crime?

422
00:42:54,822 --> 00:42:57,449
-  Any words for the victims?
-  When did you hatch the plan?

423
00:42:57,450 --> 00:42:59,910
-  Do you admit to the crime?
-  Will you plead guilty?

424
00:42:59,911 --> 00:43:01,286
Do you have anything to say?

425
00:43:01,287 --> 00:43:02,788
-  Coming through.
-  Any comments?

426
00:43:02,789 --> 00:43:03,872
Please make way.

427
00:43:03,873 --> 00:43:07,584
Police have identified
the hospital's vice director,

428
00:43:07,585 --> 00:43:11,254
Choi, as the one who planned
and orchestrated the crime.

429
00:43:11,255 --> 00:43:14,509
However, Choi has reportedly
denied all allegations.

430
00:43:16,260 --> 00:43:18,554
- He's coming out!
- There he is!

431
00:43:19,722 --> 00:43:21,182
Any comments on the matter?

432
00:43:23,476 --> 00:43:26,394
Investigators say Noh Manhui,
who carried out the crime,

433
00:43:26,395 --> 00:43:30,649
handed over a written confession
and audio recordings detailing the offense

434
00:43:30,650 --> 00:43:32,609
to police before his arrest.

435
00:43:32,610 --> 00:43:35,779
Noh insists he acted alone
and strongly denies that his wife,

436
00:43:35,780 --> 00:43:37,948
Kim, had any part in it.

437
00:43:37,949 --> 00:43:40,909
However, police believe
there's evidence that Kim conspired

438
00:43:40,910 --> 00:43:43,453
in the kidnapping and false imprisonment,

439
00:43:43,454 --> 00:43:46,873
and plan to refer her case
to the prosecutors first.

440
00:43:46,874 --> 00:43:50,253
NOH MANHUI CLAIMS HIS WIFE IS INNOCENT

441
00:44:05,476 --> 00:44:07,728
WOORI TOGETHER MEDICAL CENTER
FUND DONATION AGREEMENT

442
00:44:10,523 --> 00:44:12,567
We have to make right what we can.

443
00:44:13,359 --> 00:44:15,611
And you have to be the one to do it.

444
00:44:16,445 --> 00:44:17,446
DIRECTOR KO DONGCHAN

445
00:44:19,866 --> 00:44:22,826
WOORI TOGETHER MEDICAL CENTER

446
00:44:22,827 --> 00:44:25,996
DISTINGUISHED SERVICE AWARD
SPINE CLINICAL RESEARCH FOUNDATION

447
00:44:25,997 --> 00:44:28,790
Dr. Ko Dongchan, director
of Woori Together Medical Center,

448
00:44:28,791 --> 00:44:30,667
turned himself in to police this morning.

449
00:44:30,668 --> 00:44:34,504
Ko reportedly acknowledged responsibility
for the illegal medical practices

450
00:44:34,505 --> 00:44:38,842
and stated that he would fully
cooperate with the police investigation.

451
00:44:38,843 --> 00:44:43,305
Dr. Ko, a leading figure
in spinal neurosurgery,

452
00:44:43,306 --> 00:44:48,518
is accused of illegally obtaining
stem cells from aborted fetuses

453
00:44:48,519 --> 00:44:50,020
and using them in surgeries

454
00:44:50,021 --> 00:44:51,771
to improve the success rate…

455
00:44:51,772 --> 00:44:56,235
…of a highly anticipated spinal cord
reconstruction clinical trial.

456
00:44:57,778 --> 00:44:58,988
Yes, hello?

457
00:45:01,949 --> 00:45:04,619
I'm sorry to bother you again.

458
00:45:05,328 --> 00:45:06,620
It's no problem.

459
00:45:06,621 --> 00:45:09,873
Do you remember the video
you talked to us about?

460
00:45:09,874 --> 00:45:12,210
The video of your husband
you saw in captivity.

461
00:45:14,003 --> 00:45:15,170
Yes.

462
00:45:15,171 --> 00:45:16,546
We recovered what seems to be

463
00:45:16,547 --> 00:45:18,966
the original file
from the perp's computer.

464
00:45:19,467 --> 00:45:22,636
We just need you to confirm
if it's the same as the one you saw.

465
00:45:22,637 --> 00:45:23,638
Okay.

466
00:45:28,809 --> 00:45:30,645
I'll give you a moment.

467
00:45:40,988 --> 00:45:42,990
Sir, did you call for a driver?

468
00:45:44,200 --> 00:45:47,619
I feel like I made the call
a second ago. You got here so quickly.

469
00:45:47,620 --> 00:45:51,624
Well, I just happened to be
in the area, so I got here fast.

470
00:45:57,880 --> 00:46:00,800
You must be exhausted, sir. Oh, here.

471
00:46:01,676 --> 00:46:04,220
I got this for myself,
but you can have it.

472
00:46:05,930 --> 00:46:08,307
Oh, thanks. I appreciate it.

473
00:46:31,706 --> 00:46:32,748
Hey…

474
00:46:33,499 --> 00:46:34,500
Yeah?

475
00:46:35,918 --> 00:46:37,586
Have you ever…

476
00:46:39,422 --> 00:46:41,047
lost a loved one?

477
00:46:42,675 --> 00:46:45,677
Well, yeah, of course.
But I mean, who hasn't?

478
00:46:45,678 --> 00:46:48,347
No. Not like that.

479
00:46:49,807 --> 00:46:50,975
Like…

480
00:46:53,394 --> 00:46:56,605
Have you lost anyone that you truly love?

481
00:47:00,943 --> 00:47:02,611
I'm always trying my absolute best

482
00:47:03,487 --> 00:47:04,989
not to let that happen.

483
00:47:09,368 --> 00:47:10,453
You see…

484
00:47:14,123 --> 00:47:15,750
I've lost my little girl.

485
00:47:19,378 --> 00:47:21,797
I should have been there for my wife.

486
00:47:24,759 --> 00:47:27,094
But I didn't have the guts
to tell her the truth.

487
00:47:28,679 --> 00:47:30,014
Hmm.

488
00:47:31,098 --> 00:47:32,767
So I couldn't be there.

489
00:47:33,601 --> 00:47:35,019
I see.

490
00:47:36,562 --> 00:47:37,896
Go on.

491
00:47:37,897 --> 00:47:40,691
I want to tell my wife
the truth about everything,

492
00:47:41,650 --> 00:47:44,987
but I worry she might break down
if she found out everything.

493
00:47:47,031 --> 00:47:49,283
I can't bring myself to say anything.

494
00:47:50,701 --> 00:47:52,036
But I mean,

495
00:47:53,037 --> 00:47:56,332
don't you think things would get better
if you just talked to her about it?

496
00:47:56,916 --> 00:47:59,085
No.

497
00:48:03,297 --> 00:48:08,094
I can't let her live with the consequences
of the choices that I've made.

498
00:48:09,387 --> 00:48:11,347
But you know,

499
00:48:12,181 --> 00:48:13,474
there's a limit

500
00:48:14,225 --> 00:48:18,354
to how much you can lie.

501
00:48:21,857 --> 00:48:22,942
So…

502
00:48:26,278 --> 00:48:29,115
I said we should get divorced.

503
00:48:31,283 --> 00:48:32,493
Oh, no.

504
00:48:34,328 --> 00:48:35,995
But she said she didn't want to.

505
00:48:35,996 --> 00:48:36,997
Well…

506
00:48:40,209 --> 00:48:41,502
She said she'd never do it.

507
00:48:43,546 --> 00:48:44,630
Why's that?

508
00:48:45,131 --> 00:48:46,382
Because it's what I want.

509
00:48:49,009 --> 00:48:52,430
She doesn't want to
give me anything I want.

510
00:48:54,390 --> 00:48:56,559
I'm all out of options now.

511
00:48:58,811 --> 00:49:00,479
Anyway, that being said…

512
00:49:04,316 --> 00:49:06,693
I want you to get rid of my wife.

513
00:49:06,694 --> 00:49:09,195
What? What did you say?

514
00:49:09,196 --> 00:49:10,739
I'll pay you, okay?

515
00:49:11,574 --> 00:49:13,951
I'll pay you 300… No.

516
00:49:15,953 --> 00:49:18,581
I'll pay you 500 million won. So please.

517
00:49:21,000 --> 00:49:25,337
So you want me to get rid of your wife?

518
00:49:27,173 --> 00:49:29,175
Seyun could…

519
00:49:35,431 --> 00:49:39,226
She could never be happy
as long as she's with me.

520
00:49:40,186 --> 00:49:41,270
So…

521
00:49:43,314 --> 00:49:44,982
I want you…

522
00:49:49,862 --> 00:49:51,655
to take my wife

523
00:49:52,907 --> 00:49:54,450
out of my life.

524
00:50:00,831 --> 00:50:04,001
So she won't be haunted by the truth…

525
00:50:09,590 --> 00:50:12,383
or be lonely because of all my lies.

526
00:50:12,384 --> 00:50:13,469
I just…

527
00:50:16,722 --> 00:50:18,933
…I want her to stay in the dark…

528
00:50:26,357 --> 00:50:27,815
and disappear…

529
00:50:30,402 --> 00:50:32,321
…from my life.

530
00:50:38,244 --> 00:50:41,455
The further away she stays from me…

531
00:50:47,795 --> 00:50:51,048
the happier she would be in life.

532
00:51:31,380 --> 00:51:32,798
Did you get it checked out?

533
00:51:34,550 --> 00:51:35,593
Yeah.

534
00:51:36,427 --> 00:51:37,428
What did they say?

535
00:51:38,429 --> 00:51:42,265
To keep going to therapy. They said
it should be back to normal soon.

536
00:51:42,266 --> 00:51:43,726
And your work?

537
00:51:44,768 --> 00:51:46,353
Can you still do surgeries?

538
00:51:52,693 --> 00:51:53,694
I see.

539
00:51:57,615 --> 00:51:59,449
It's fine. I'll be fine.

540
00:51:59,450 --> 00:52:01,535
Stop saying you're fine.

541
00:52:02,161 --> 00:52:03,828
This is clearly not fine.

542
00:52:03,829 --> 00:52:05,664
I know how much it means to…

543
00:52:06,665 --> 00:52:08,167
I mean it, I'm fine.

544
00:52:09,460 --> 00:52:11,128
I can move it and all.

545
00:52:11,879 --> 00:52:12,962
That's what matters.

546
00:52:16,050 --> 00:52:17,551
You're always like this.

547
00:52:20,929 --> 00:52:23,891
It wouldn't have gotten this bad
if you'd gotten surgery right away.

548
00:52:32,024 --> 00:52:33,275
I watched…

549
00:52:35,277 --> 00:52:36,278
that video of you.

550
00:52:44,411 --> 00:52:45,954
I finally get it.

551
00:52:46,830 --> 00:52:48,874
How you must have felt at the time.

552
00:52:50,918 --> 00:52:53,337
You didn't want to get rid of me.

553
00:52:55,422 --> 00:52:57,883
You wanted to protect me.

554
00:52:59,843 --> 00:53:01,428
But that made things clearer for me.

555
00:53:04,223 --> 00:53:06,058
We'll always be like this.

556
00:53:08,394 --> 00:53:11,104
You'll hide things to protect me,

557
00:53:11,105 --> 00:53:13,399
and I'll be left in the dark and get hurt.

558
00:53:17,486 --> 00:53:19,488
That's why I'm going to let go of you.

559
00:53:25,244 --> 00:53:26,453
Let's get divorced.

560
00:53:33,419 --> 00:53:34,920
It's not your fault, though.

561
00:53:39,466 --> 00:53:40,467
I know.

562
00:53:42,511 --> 00:53:44,179
And it's not your fault, either.

563
00:53:47,850 --> 00:53:49,476
The way we love each other…

564
00:53:52,062 --> 00:53:53,605
is just very different.

565
00:53:58,777 --> 00:54:00,820
KANG TAEJU
NEUROSURGERY CLINIC

566
00:54:00,821 --> 00:54:02,363
Come in.

567
00:54:02,364 --> 00:54:03,656
CONSULTATION ROOM

568
00:54:03,657 --> 00:54:06,326
Have you been doing
the exercise I taught you last time?

569
00:54:06,994 --> 00:54:10,246
I did, but it just hurt more.

570
00:54:10,247 --> 00:54:11,248
Pardon?

571
00:54:11,832 --> 00:54:13,458
Well, that's why you have to do it.

572
00:54:13,459 --> 00:54:17,044
My goodness, you and your nagging.

573
00:54:17,045 --> 00:54:18,881
That's what you're here for, isn't it?

574
00:54:20,674 --> 00:54:22,593
Make sure to receive
physical therapy, okay?

575
00:54:24,219 --> 00:54:27,389
Grandma, you have to
actually do it this time.

576
00:54:28,140 --> 00:54:30,100
All right.

577
00:54:31,268 --> 00:54:32,936
-  Thank you, Doctor.
- Okay, bye.

578
00:54:33,437 --> 00:54:34,605
Take care, ma'am.

579
00:55:04,134 --> 00:55:06,428
SEOKGI CHUEOTANG

580
00:55:07,012 --> 00:55:08,013
There it is.

581
00:55:09,139 --> 00:55:11,141
- Here.
- Go on.

582
00:55:12,226 --> 00:55:15,521
Why don't you come by more often?

583
00:55:16,230 --> 00:55:18,106
How are things over there?

584
00:55:19,107 --> 00:55:21,025
Don't you get lonely?

585
00:55:21,026 --> 00:55:22,568
No, it's good.

586
00:55:22,569 --> 00:55:24,737
You know, the patients are nice.

587
00:55:24,738 --> 00:55:26,781
It's nice and quiet.

588
00:55:26,782 --> 00:55:28,157
Geez.

589
00:55:28,158 --> 00:55:31,411
Stop saying it's all good.
Mom's clearly worried about you.

590
00:55:32,162 --> 00:55:34,080
When will you grow up?

591
00:55:34,081 --> 00:55:35,790
Oh, hey, Mom. This is for you.

592
00:55:35,791 --> 00:55:36,959
What's all this?

593
00:55:37,668 --> 00:55:40,963
You seem to get worse with every checkup.
Make sure you take these.

594
00:55:42,923 --> 00:55:46,509
I was actually worried
because my numbers keep dropping.

595
00:55:46,510 --> 00:55:50,096
You don't want a fracture
or a broken bone.

596
00:55:50,097 --> 00:55:52,766
A lot of patients come in
after falling accidents.

597
00:55:53,809 --> 00:55:56,061
- I got you a box, too.
- Really?

598
00:55:56,812 --> 00:55:59,356
I see you've actually grown up.

599
00:55:59,856 --> 00:56:02,817
I mean, it's about time
I took care of myself.

600
00:56:02,818 --> 00:56:05,946
Okay, why don't we…

601
00:56:06,738 --> 00:56:11,033
Yeah, let's take one together.

602
00:56:11,034 --> 00:56:12,368
- Yeah?
- Here, take one.

603
00:56:12,369 --> 00:56:13,869
Okay.

604
00:56:13,870 --> 00:56:15,580
- You too.
- Wow, me too?

605
00:56:15,581 --> 00:56:16,998
Yes.

606
00:56:20,544 --> 00:56:21,545
There.

607
00:56:22,629 --> 00:56:24,589
All right, let's take it.

608
00:56:24,590 --> 00:56:26,299
Here's to our health!

609
00:56:26,300 --> 00:56:28,051
- To our health!
- To our health!

610
00:56:32,556 --> 00:56:33,682
Goodness.

611
00:56:34,641 --> 00:56:36,559
Oh, welcome.

612
00:56:36,560 --> 00:56:37,643
-  Yeah, hi.
- This way.

613
00:56:37,644 --> 00:56:38,729
Okay.

614
00:56:42,316 --> 00:56:45,235
So, are you in touch at all?

615
00:56:46,153 --> 00:56:48,322
Do you hear from her?

616
00:56:50,449 --> 00:56:52,034
I'm sure she's doing fine.

617
00:56:56,663 --> 00:57:00,082
You know, Mom,
a lot of women do come to see me.

618
00:57:00,083 --> 00:57:01,084
What?

619
00:57:01,710 --> 00:57:02,753
It's true.

620
00:57:03,754 --> 00:57:05,839
It's just that
they're a bit older than you.

621
00:57:06,590 --> 00:57:09,592
They mostly come in with knee pain.

622
00:57:09,593 --> 00:57:12,763
Goodness, you silly boy.

623
00:57:13,597 --> 00:57:16,892
Well, it's good to see you
make jokes and laugh now.

624
00:57:19,061 --> 00:57:20,854
My goodness.

625
00:57:56,264 --> 00:57:58,182
KANG HAYUN
MAY 20, 2022 - JANUARY 28, 2025

626
00:57:58,183 --> 00:58:00,143
Hey, Hayun. Daddy's here.

627
00:58:02,062 --> 00:58:03,480
How have you been?

628
00:58:05,565 --> 00:58:08,610
WE WILL REMEMBER YOU
LOVE YOU, SWEETHEART

629
00:58:30,173 --> 00:58:31,258
How have you been?

630
00:58:32,050 --> 00:58:33,051
Good.

631
00:58:34,845 --> 00:58:35,846
That's good.

632
00:58:37,848 --> 00:58:38,932
What about you?

633
00:58:41,935 --> 00:58:43,854
I'm getting there.

634
00:59:02,497 --> 00:59:03,915
I'm going to take a walk.

635
00:59:06,877 --> 00:59:07,878
Okay.

636
00:59:11,757 --> 00:59:13,425
Can I walk with you?

637
00:59:16,511 --> 00:59:17,595
Sure.

638
00:59:50,879 --> 00:59:55,717
THE HUSBAND

639
01:01:16,882 --> 01:01:19,843
THANK YOU FOR WATCHING THE HUSBAND

640
01:01:21,136 --> 01:01:23,138
Translated by Hyun Sik Yoon
